        "And the Lord spoke to Moses, saying,",
        "“Speak to the children of Israel, saying, ‘If a woman have conceived seed, and born a man child: then she will be unclean seven days; according to the days of the separation for her infirmity will she be unclean.’”",
        "“And in the eighth day the flesh of his foreskin will be circumcised.”",
