        "And the Lord spoke to Moses, saying,",
        "“Make you two trumpets of silver; of a whole piece will you make them: that you may use them for the calling of the assembly, and for the journeying of the camps.”",
        "“And when they will blow with them, all the assembly will assemble themselves to you at the door of the tabernacle of the congregation.”",
