        "So the Philistines were subdued, and they came no more into the coast of Israel: and the hand of the Lord was against the Philistines all the days of Samuel.",
        "And the cities which the Philistines had taken from Israel were restored to Israel, from Ekron even to Gath; and the coasts of it did Israel deliver out of the hands of the Philistines. And there was peace between Israel and the Amorites.",
