        "Now it came to pass upon a day, that Jonathan the son of Saul said to the young man that bore his armor, “Come, and let us go over to the Philistines’ garrison, that is on the other side.” But he told not his father.",
        "And Saul delayed in the uttermost part of Gibeah under a pomegranate tree which is in Migron: and the people that were with him were about six hundred men;",
